# Line-ending discipline: SQL migrations are sha256-checksummed by
# server/db/migrate.mjs, and deploy shell scripts must stay POSIX-portable.
# Pin both to LF so a Windows checkout can never flip them to CRLF and
# break production checksum verification (004 incident, 2026-08-17).
*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
